<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-MIM 95/96 op profit A$76.7 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-MIM 95/96 op profit A$76.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>53 weeks to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating		     profit 76.7 vs loss 9.2</p>
<p>    Net			    profit 170.6 vs loss 216.10</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     1.25 vs 2.50</p>
<p>NOTE: MIM Holdings Ltd is a mining and smelting group. Operating profit is before abnormal pre-tax profit A$107.6 million and before an exchange gains of A$10.1 million.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     3.75 vs 5.00</p>
